{"id":"0caf6a4fb6071bd3","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md","title":"完备格上单调算子的固定点存在","display":"thm-fixed-point-existence — 完备格上单调算子的固定点存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-fixed-point-existence","aliases":["91-thm-fixed-point-existence","91-thm-kripke-fixed-point"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-existence — 完备格上单调算子的固定点存在","depends_on":["[[91-df-monotonicity]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-fixed-point-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-fixed-point-existence</span><span>91-thm-kripke-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-existence — 完备格上单调算子的固定点存在"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55157d609cf296e7\" href=\"?note=55157d609cf296e7\" title=\"91-df-monotonicity\">91-df-monotonicity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc4d1a14a37aabf\" href=\"?note=2bc4d1a14a37aabf\" title=\"91-df-maximal-fixed-point\">91-df-maximal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (完备格)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\(\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\sqsubseteq)\">\\((L,\\sqsubseteq)\\)</span> 是完备格)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:L\\to L\">\\(J:L\\to L\\)</span> (自映射)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Knaster–Tarski 定理。若强 Kleene 真理跳跃扩展在一个完备信息格上，\n可直接应用本定理。只取一致三值信息时，该偏序通常不是完备格；这时应\n利用递增链的并保持一致以及超限迭代，另证极小一致固定点存在。</p>\n<p>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 已定义”不足以推出固定点存在：例如任意集合上的无固定点置换同样\n定义良好。完备格、自映射和单调性是这里明确使用的条件；固定点是否\n唯一还要分析具体算子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"55157d609cf296e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-monotonicity]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-maximal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"2bc4d1a14a37aabf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\sqsubseteq)","display":false},{"tex":"J:L\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\,(x\\sqsubseteq y\\to J(x)\\sqsubseteq J(y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in L:J(x)=x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigwedge\\{x\\in L:J(x)\\sqsubseteq x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\bigvee\\{x\\in L:x\\sqsubseteq J(x)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CLat}(L,\\sqsubseteq)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{(L,\\sqsubseteq)}(J)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\operatorname{lfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{gfp}(J)\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"J","display":fal